  "steps": [
    "Season the beef strips and sear in batches in olive oil over high heat until browned. Set aside.",
    "In the same pan, add the butter, diced onion and garlic, cook until softened.",
    "Stir in the paprika and mustard, cook for 1 minute.",
    "Pour in the cooking cream, bring to a gentle simmer.",
    "Return the beef to the pan, simmer for 5-8 minutes until the sauce thickens and the beef is tender.",
    "Finish with sliced green onions, season to taste, and serve."
